["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Reading sign is a skill, and skills are built on your feet. One walk with this list teaches more than ten sessions on the couch.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 352\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Map of the sign walk. Start at the truck, walk along the edge where grassland meets Douglas fir, past a creek and pond and a fence corner, and loop back. Ten numbered stops: track, scat, trail, browse, bed seen from the edge, rub, grouse sign, water sign, fence crossing, predator sign. Mid morning, 2 to 3 hours.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"352\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The 10 sign walk</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"44\" width=\"384\" height=\"300\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e9e0b8\"/>\n<path d=\"M8 54 Q8 44 18 44 H382 Q392 44 392 54 V154 C340 144 300 104 250 118 C200 132 150 84 100 94 C60 102 30 84 8 96z\" fill=\"#6f8a5a\"/>\n<circle cx=\"244.2\" cy=\"92.7\" r=\"8.4\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".12\"/><circle cx=\"244.2\" cy=\"90.7\" r=\"8.4\" fill=\"#3d5a3a\"/><circle cx=\"241.7\" cy=\"88.2\" r=\"3.8\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n<circle cx=\"359.3\" cy=\"110.6\" r=\"8.8\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".12\"/><circle cx=\"359.3\" cy=\"108.6\" r=\"8.8\" fill=\"#3d5a3a\"/><circle cx=\"356.7\" cy=\"106.0\" r=\"3.9\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n<circle cx=\"30.4\" cy=\"70.8\" r=\"8.8\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".12\"/><circle cx=\"30.4\" cy=\"68.8\" r=\"8.8\" fill=\"#3d5a3a\"/><circle cx=\"27.8\" cy=\"66.2\" r=\"4.0\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n<circle cx=\"253.6\" cy=\"98.4\" r=\"6.3\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".12\"/><circle cx=\"253.6\" cy=\"96.4\" r=\"6.3\" fill=\"#3d5a3a\"/><circle cx=\"251.7\" cy=\"94.5\" r=\"2.9\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n<circle cx=\"215.8\" cy=\"86.7\" r=\"6.0\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\